Third-party material

This product bundles no third-party assets. Rust dependencies are listed in Cargo.lock under their
own permissive licenses (checked by `cargo xtask licenses`). Builds made with craft-fonts
(CRAFT_FONTS_DIR) also embed the fonts listed in its ATTRIBUTION.md; builds made with craft-i18n
(CRAFT_I18N_DIR) embed its translation catalogs. The per-file asset list is in ATTRIBUTION.md.
